        <section id="velocity" class="doc-section">
          <p class="section-number">30</p>
          <h2>Vector Velocity model <span class="doc-soon">Coming soon</span></h2>
          <p>
            Vector Velocity is Vector's own model, tuned for the loop Vector actually runs — planning, tool calls,
